<title>USA: Meteor Industries overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Meteor Industries overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meteor Industries Inc said on Wednesday that the underwriter of its public offering exercised the overallotment option to purchase a block of shares and redeemable warrants, netting the company $438,480 in proceeds.</p>
<p>The underwriter, Westport Resources Investment Services Inc, purchased 90,000 shares at $5.50 per share, and 90,000 redeemable warrants at $0.10 per warrant.</p>
<p>Meteor markets and distributes refined petroleum and related products, and provides environmental services through its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
